  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HIV/AIDS - Western Africa - Multicountry West Africa ITPC (01-Jan-2017-31-Dec-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicountry West Africa ITPC, HIV, International Treatment Preparedness Coalition (ITPC)This program has the following goals: Increase access to antiretroviral therapy for people living with HIV in 11 priority countries in West Africa. The objectives of this program are: Objective: To set up community treatment observatories in 11 priority countries in West Africa and a regional treatment observatory</narrative>
  </description>
